  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procaps Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed financing consists of a loan to Procaps S.A. (&quot;Procaps&quot; or &quot;the Company&quot;) in an aggregate amount of up to US$20 million for a term of up to three years. The project aims to support the expansion plan of Procaps, a company dedicated to the development, production and marketing of pharmaceutical drugs and advanced drug delivery system. The loan will properly finance the Company&apos;s long cash cycles, reducing short-term pressure, and provide additional resources for continued Research and Development investment and capital expenditures, both regulatory and growth-related.</narrative>
  </description>
